# PlayNex / DA SPORTZ order WhatsApp is sent by the Lambda backend via Twilio.
# No Meta Cloud API token is required in the mobile app.
#
# Flow:
# - Cash / pay-at-outlet services → POST /api/create-order (paymentMethod=payatoutlet) → "customer notified"
# - UPI → create-order + Zoho + POST /api/verify-payment (or Zoho webhook) → Twilio WhatsApp
#
# Expo web on localhost hits CORS on the Lambda. Run a local proxy:
#   npm run proxy
#   npm run web
# Or override:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://localhost:8787
